WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.972
Meet Cannabis, a community built around a simple idea: putting computing

00:00:04.972 --> 00:00:06.780
power to useful work.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:13.426
The project brings together open code, clear rules and privacy-conscious design,

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:17.120
with a community allocation built around people.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.433
As we prepare the public launch, you can explore the source,

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:26.907
contribute your skills and help shape what comes next. We look

00:00:26.907 --> 00:00:28.940
forward to building it together.
